<title>USA: U.S. meat output 0.9 pct above a week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 0.9 pct above a week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, May 3, rose 0.9 at 805.6 million lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>03-May-97	485.5     6.6	309.1     4.4	805.6</p>
<p>26-Apr-97	482.8     6.2	304.8     4.3	798.1</p>
<p>Change:	    0.6%    6.5%	 1.4%    2.3%	0.9%</p>
<p>04-May-96	503.8     6.5	331.7     5.1	847.1</p>
<p>Change:	   -3.6%    1.5%	-6.8%  -13.7%     -4.9%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:	8276.9  112.6     5667.0    87.8    14144.3</p>
<p>1996 YTD:	8595.8  119.4     5977.4   100.0    14792.6</p>
<p>Change:	   -3.7%   -5.7%	-5.2%  -12.2%     -4.4%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE    CALVES/VEALERS    HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>03-May-97     703,000	   31,000     1,649,000	66,000</p>
<p>26-Apr-97     699,000	   29,000     1,628,000	66,000</p>
<p>Change:	   0.6%	     6.9%	    1.3%	  0.0%</p>
<p>04-May-96     724,000	   30,000     1,792,000	75,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -2.9%	     3.3%	   -8.0%	-12.0%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:  12,001,000	  534,000    30,156,000   1,330,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:* 12,224,000	  565,000    32,202,000   1,524,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.8%	    -5.4%	   -6.4%	-12.7%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions  </p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS    HOGS  SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>03-May-97    Est    1160	  349	    256	  136</p>
<p>26-Apr-97    Est    1163	  349	    256	  134</p>
<p>04-May-96    Actual 1160	  373	    256	  136</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>03-May-97    Est     694	  216	    188	   67</p>
<p>26-Apr-97    Est     694	  216	    188	   66</p>
<p>04-May-96    Actual  699	  220	    186	   67</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>19-Apr-97     50.6%	 30.2%	17.2%	  2.0%</p>
<p>20-Apr-96     50.9%	 27.5%	19.5%	  2.1%</p>
<p>THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	     SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>19-Apr-97	  96.0%		    3.3%	  0.7%</p>
<p>20-Apr-96	  95.1%		    4.1%	  0.8%</p>
<p>(1) Previous week estimates may be revised. Year ago data are actuals.</p>
<p>(2) Excludes lard.     (3) Totals may not add due to rounding.</p>
<p>1997 totals are subject to revision *1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions</p>
